        WHEN "Mancare" MOVE "Y" TO W-VALID
        WHEN "Hobby" MOVE "Y" TO W-VALID
        WHEN "Utilitati" MOVE "Y" TO W-VALID
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "N" TO W-VALID
    END-EVALUATE.

